{"seq":1,"slug":"history-stack","title":"历史栈：撑起九成撤销功能的双栈实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-undo-redo-history/history/history-stack","wordCount":1213,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"历史栈-撑起九成撤销功能的双栈实现\">历史栈：撑起九成撤销功能的双栈实现</h1><p>世界上绝大多数应用的撤销功能，本质就是两个数组和一个几乎不出错的循环。别因为它简单就轻视——历史栈是所有更复杂历史结构（分支树、选择性撤销、协同）的地基，而它那几条看似显然的不变量，恰恰是新手最容易违反、最难 debug 的地方。&quot;撤销后再操作，重做键还亮着按下去却跳到不相干的状态&quot;&quot;撤销撤过头了 undo 栈空了却还在弹&quot;——这类经典 bug 全是不变量没守住。这一节把双栈实现从数据结构、核心操作、不变量到容量管理，一次讲到能直接投产的程度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个栈与一条铁律\">核心概念：两个栈与一条铁律</h2><p>双栈模型极简：<code>undoStack</code> 存&quot;已应用、可撤销&quot;的历史项，<code>redoStack</code> 存&quot;已撤销、可重做&quot;的历史项。三个操作在两个栈之间搬运历史项。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新操作 execute] --&gt; B[压入 undoStack]&#10;  A --&gt; C[清空 redoStack]&#10;  D[undo] --&gt; E[undoStack 弹出栈顶]&#10;  E --&gt; F[执行其 undo]&#10;  E --&gt; G[压入 redoStack]&#10;  H[redo] --&gt; I[redoStack 弹出栈顶]&#10;  I --&gt; J[执行其 redo/execute]&#10;  I --&gt; K[压回 undoStack]\">graph TD\n  A[新操作 execute] --&gt; B[压入 undoStack]\n  A --&gt; C[清空 redoStack]\n  D[undo] --&gt; E[undoStack 弹出栈顶]\n  E --&gt; F[执行其 undo]\n  E --&gt; G[压入 redoStack]\n  H[redo] --&gt; I[redoStack 弹出栈顶]\n  I --&gt; J[执行其 redo/execute]\n  I --&gt; K[压回 undoStack]</pre><p>这张图里藏着整个历史栈最重要的一条铁律：<strong>新操作发生时必须清空 redoStack</strong>。原因是一旦用户撤销几步后又做了新编辑，历史就分岔了——原来的&quot;未来&quot;不再是当前分支的未来，重做它会导致状态不一致。清空 redo 是线性历史保持自洽的代价，这与 <a href=\"../foundations/history-model\">历史数据模型</a> 里&quot;截断 cursor 右侧&quot;是同一件事的两种说法。若你舍不得清空、想保留那条被丢弃的分支，就跨入了 <a href=\"branching-history\">分支历史树</a> 的领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一份可投产的实现\">一份可投产的实现</h2><p>下面是带合并与容量限制的完整历史管理器骨架，<code>Command</code> 接口沿用 <a href=\"../command/command-pattern\">命令模式</a> 的定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Command {&#10;  execute(): void;&#10;  undo(): void;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  merge?(n: Command): Command | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class History {&#10;  private undoStack: Command[] = [];&#10;  private redoStack: Command[] = [];&#10;  constructor(private limit = 100) {}&#10;&#10;  execute(cmd: Command) {&#10;    cmd.execute();&#10;    const top = this.undoStack.at(-1);&#10;    const merged = top?.merge?.(cmd);&#10;    if (merged) this.undoStack[this.undoStack.length - 1] = merged;&#10;    else this.undoStack.push(cmd);&#10;    this.redoStack.length = 0; // 铁律：新操作清空 redo&#10;    if (this.undoStack.length &gt; this.limit) this.undoStack.shift(); // 淘汰最旧&#10;  }&#10;  undo() {&#10;    const cmd = this.undoStack.pop();&#10;    if (!cmd) return; // 空栈保护&#10;    cmd.undo();&#10;    this.redoStack.push(cmd);&#10;  }&#10;  redo() {&#10;    const cmd = this.redoStack.pop();&#10;    if (!cmd) return;&#10;    cmd.execute();&#10;    this.undoStack.push(cmd);&#10;  }&#10;  get canUndo() {&#10;    return this.undoStack.length &gt; 0;&#10;  }&#10;  get canRedo() {&#10;    return this.redoStack.length &gt; 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  undo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  merge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> History</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> undoStack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> redoStack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.undoStack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color: